      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REAL BONNIE (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by one length at Gosford in a handy 29.44 beating Fascinate Suzie. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Ideally placed to take this out. HEY MAC (3) was a last start winner (29.45) from Box 1 at Gosford. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. FASCINATE JOHN (2) overcame a check to finish in the minors of a Grade 4/5 last time (22.74) at Gosford over 388m. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Key chance on best form. REBORN MYSTIQUE (5) is in winning form and worth including in the main hopes.",
